# Normalise text files to LF in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# Why this exists: .prettierrc.json sets `endOfLine: "lf"`, while Windows
# checkouts with the system-level `core.autocrlf=true` produced 62 false
# `npm run format:check` failures (files that were byte-identical to the
# index but checked out with CRLF). Pinning `eol=lf` here makes the working
# tree match what CI sees, so the formatter gate can be trusted locally.
#
# Deeper .gitattributes files win for their own subtree:
#   src/assets/.gitattributes                 (*.svg -text)
#   src/assets/icons/phosphor/.gitattributes  (*.svg -text)
#   docs/design/ppt-kit/upstream/.gitattributes (* -text)

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalise line endings, never diff as text.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.bmp   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.pptx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.zip   binary
*.emf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
